 Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false},{"analytics_identifier":"D6","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/department-for-education","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/department-for-education","base_path":"/government/organisations/department-for-education","content_id":"ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37","details":{"acronym":"DfE","brand":"department-for-education","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb9af91e9ee4b2c327/s960_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb3e81003ae042250c/s300_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Department <br/>for Education"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Department for Education","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/department-for-education","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/alistair-carns","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/alistair-carns","base_path":"/government/people/alistair-carns","content_id":"85567506-c566-4a74-9f4d-412d540102f5","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-11T19:45:19Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Alistair Carns DSO OBE MC MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/alistair-carns","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/jacqui-smith","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/jacqui-smith","base_path":"/government/people/jacqui-smith","content_id":"8d7c6906-f1dd-4a7d-ba70-ecd1a08aefe6","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-11T12:37:23Z","schema_name":"person","title":"The Rt Hon Baroness Smith of Malvern","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/jacqui-smith","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--245","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--245","base_path":"/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--245","content_id":"4f2c5528-8485-4290-9394-8d57cc648c00","details":{"body":"<ul>\n  <li>Implementation of relevant SDR Vision and Defence Investment Plan</li>\n  <li>Oversight of Military Strategic Headquarters (MSHQ)</li>\n  <li>Global Operations and commitments</li>\n  <li>Force Posture and Deployment</li>\n  <li>Homeland Defence and the National Conversation</li>\n  <li>Ukraine support – operations</li>\n  <li>Implementation and delivery of the Uncrewed Systems Centre and Uncrewed Systems Force</li>\n  <li>Intelligence</li>\n  <li>North Atlantic Treaty Organisation (NATO) operations and planning</li>\n  <li>Permanent Joint Operational Bases and Overseas Territories</li>\n  <li>Crisis response</li>\n  <li>Military Aid to Civilian Authority (MACA)</li>\n  <li>Armed Forces Bill</li>\n  <li>UN Peacekeeping and Human Security Call Out Orders</li>\n  <li>Overseas Security and Justice Assistance Reports</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:29:43Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State (Minister for the Armed Forces)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--245","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--175","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--175","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--175","content_id":"5dc89f34-86e1-4173-9980-0a525d4ef2f3","details":{"body":"<p>The minister’s Department for Education (DfE) responsibilities include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>governance, intervention and accountability of further education colleges</li>\n  <li>funding for education and training, provision and outcomes for 16- to 19-year-olds</li>\n  <li>further education financial stability and workforce</li>\n  <li>access to higher education, participation and lifelong learning entitlement</li>\n  <li>quality of higher education and the student experience (including the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.officeforstudents.org.uk/\">Office for Students</a>)</li>\n  <li>student finance (including the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/student-loans-company\">Student Loans Company</a>)</li>\n  <li>technical and vocational qualifications (level 3 and below), including T Levels</li>\n  <li>higher technical education (levels 4 and 5)</li>\n  <li>careers advice</li>\n  <li>support for young people aged 16 to 19 not in employment, education or training (NEET)</li>\n  <li>skills strategy and delivery</li>\n  <li>technical excellence colleges</li>\n  <li>international education</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The minister’s Department for Work and Pensions (DWP) responsibilities include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/skills-england\">Skills England</a> and Industry Training Boards</li>\n  <li>adult education, including basic skills</li>\n  <li>apprenticeships, including the growth and skills levy</li>\n  <li>skills bootcamps</li>\n  <li>sector skills packages</li>\n  <li>careers advice and support for young people over the age of 19 not in employment, education or training (NEET)</li>\n  <li>Youth Guarantee</li>\n</ul>\n\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-15T17:15:41Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Skills)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--175","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence/working-armed-forces","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence/working-armed-forces","base_path":"/defence/working-armed-forces","content_id":"8ff8cf05-a6e6-4757-a896-4fabd9f3229a","details":{"internal_name":"Armed forces [M] (level 2, defence theme)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","base_path":"/defence-and-armed-forces","content_id":"e491505c-77ae-45b2-84be-8c94b94f6a2b","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Defence and armed forces","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e